{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Terrafarmers \u2014 Tame. Build. Survive.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The universe is wild. Planets are untamed. But where others see danger - you see opportunity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3055720/extras/c76db586b8fa84fa4005c95d76604246.poster.avif?t=1758969962\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3055720/extras/c76db586b8fa84fa4005c95d76604246.webm?t=1758969962\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3055720/extras/c76db586b8fa84fa4005c95d76604246.mp4?t=1758969962\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Terrafarmers</i>, you lead a daring colonization project on distant worlds. Turn hostile alien terrain into thriving ecosystems ready for human life. Good old-fashioned hard work can lead to automated systems.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build and expand your base</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create sustainable ecosystems</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the planets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight alien threats</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow exotic plants</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft, automate, and optimize</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn barren land into a paradise</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3055720/extras/fc3e04693266f0a1b82b76f3234709c0.poster.avif?t=1758969962\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3055720/extras/fc3e04693266f0a1b82b76f3234709c0.webm?t=1758969962\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3055720/extras/fc3e04693266f0a1b82b76f3234709c0.mp4?t=1758969962\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earth is overcrowded. The race for new worlds has begun. Settle your first planet, harness its resources, and when you're ready - conquer another. Expand your reach. Create your own interplanetary network.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3055720/extras/51bc53c852c38b2c2a28f210b942ddfc.poster.avif?t=1758969962\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3055720/extras/51bc53c852c38b2c2a28f210b942ddfc.webm?t=1758969962\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3055720/extras/51bc53c852c38b2c2a28f210b942ddfc.mp4?t=1758969962\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Play solo or team up in co-op!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You don\u2019t have to go it alone. <i>Terrafarmers</i> features full co-op gameplay \u2014 build together, survive together.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3055720?t=1758969962","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3055720/9a4716dfb856eea32bb37a1fd81aeddeba769eaf/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1758969962","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3055720/3edf6df27be11cc0ca1130ed4a826914cdaff742/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758969962","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.s