s</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the planets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight alien threats</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow exotic plants</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft, automate, and optimize</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn barren land into a paradise</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3055720/extras/fc3e04693266f0a1b82b76f3234709c0.poster.avif?t=1758969962\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3055720/extras/fc3e04693266f0a1b82b76f3234709c0.webm?t=1758969962\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3055720/extras/fc3e04693266f0a1b82b76f3234709c0.mp4?t=1758969962\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earth is overcrowded. The race for new worlds has begun. Settle your first planet, harness its resources, and when you're ready - conquer another. Expand your reach. Create your own interplanetary network.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3055720/extras/51bc53c852c38b2c2a28f210b942ddfc.poster.avif?t=1758969962\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3055720/extras/51bc53c852c38b2c2a28f210b942ddfc.webm?t=1758969962\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3055720/extras/51bc53c852c38b2c2a28f210b942ddfc.mp4?t=1758969962\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Play solo or team up in co-op!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You don\u2019t have to go it alone. <i>Terrafarmers</i> features full co-op gameplay \u2014 build together, survive together.</p>","developers":["Rejected Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3055720/35a04dfa18eb15382e0c9224565d356960942600/header.jpg?t=1758969962","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Mac OS 10.13<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> i5 8259U 2.3 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 775M, 2 GB , AMD Radeon 555, 2 GB, Intel Iris Plus 655<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 6 MB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Mac OS 10.13<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> i5 3.4 Ghz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Radeon Pro 570<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 6 MB available space</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3055720/2023453020/395c83265f5f173e696abe6e5f03aa0fe79cbbe8/1758903776/dash_av1.mpd?t=1758906044","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3055720/2023453020/395c83265f5f173e696abe6e5f03aa0fe79cbbe8/1758903776/dash_h264.mpd?t=1758906044","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3055720/2023453020/395c83265f5f173e696abe6e5f03aa0fe79cbbe8/1758903776/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1758906044","id":257206111,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257206111/movie480.mp4?t=1758906044","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/s